      R1 task 081 extended `docs/architecture/communication-intelligence-architecture.md` (the canonical R4 substrate) with the thread model + ACS transport + inbound ingestor seam. R2 adds the READ/QUERY/ORGANIZE layer on top — the biggest as-built additions since R1. This task documents them by extending the SAME doc, keeping ONE communication architecture narrative (§11: R2 is the read/organize layer, not a new subsystem).

      The task-004 participant-junction ADR is the codified schema decision; this doc is the architecture-level companion — it describes the delivered read/query/participant structure + rationale and points at that ADR + the code entry points (read service, access filter, thread resolver, participant rung, junction).

